{
  "id": "p08-a-30",
  "title_zh": "限制断网原因结论并安排隔离测试",
  "topic_id": "work",
  "scenario": {
    "id": "network-fault-investigation-boundary",
    "label_zh": "核对断网调查的证据范围",
    "goal_zh": "区分内部故障假设与已确认事实，约定单独测试更新并向同事说明当前未知原因"
  },
  "participants": [
    "Dev",
    "Lena"
  ],
  "context_zh": "技术支持同事讨论一次办公室网络中断后的测试记录。",
  "author": "author-phase08-a",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "p08-a-30-s01",
      "speaker": "Dev",
      "text": "Initially, I thought it was an internal network fault because only our team reported it."
    },
    {
      "id": "p08-a-30-s02",
      "speaker": "Lena",
      "text": "But we haven't asked the other teams yet. We should isolate the problem before naming a cause."
    },
    {
      "id": "p08-a-30-s03",
      "speaker": "Dev",
      "text": "It happened just after the update, hence my suspicion that the update was involved."
    },
    {
      "id": "p08-a-30-s04",
      "speaker": "Lena",
      "text": "The timing is a clue, not proof. Can we test the update on a spare machine?"
    },
    {
      "id": "p08-a-30-s05",
      "speaker": "Dev",
      "text": "Yes. Does the fact that it happened twice make another outage inevitable?"
    },
    {
      "id": "p08-a-30-s06",
      "speaker": "Lena",
      "text": "No. Repeating a fault doesn't mean it will inevitably happen every time, especially when the conditions differ."
    },
    {
      "id": "p08-a-30-s07",
      "speaker": "Dev",
      "text": "I'll test one machine separately and record the network settings as well."
    },
    {
      "id": "p08-a-30-s08",
      "speaker": "Lena",
      "text": "And I'll ask the other teams what they saw. For now, let's tell people the cause is still under investigation."
    }
  ],
